  "id": "spreading-depression",
  "term": "spreading depression",
  "definition": "Spreading depression, specifically cortical spreading depression, is a biological brain process in which a wave spreads across the cortex in a changing pattern. It is described as a pathophysiological phenomenon linked to some neurological disorders, and the wave may move through the whole cortex or skip some regions.",
